DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Bradford Brunch: Sunshine & Sunflowers on Sund
 ay\, August 9\, from 10:30am to 1:00pm at Baxter Dining Hall!\nCelebrate 
 the season with a bright and cheerful brunch featuring a tropical-inspire
 d menu in a fun Sunshine & Sunflowers atmosphere. Enjoy delicious food\, 
 festive décor\, and great company while savoring a taste of the tropics.\
 nThis event is open to the public\, including IU students\, faculty\, sta
 ff\, alumni\, and community members. Whether you're gathering with friend
 s\, family\, or colleagues\, everyone is welcome!\nAdmission: $12 per per
 son (pay at the door). Children three and under free.\nWe look forward to
  seeing you for a sunny and delicious brunch!\nPlease RSVP: https://event
 s.iu.edu/iub-featured/event/2356296-bradford-brunch\n\nHosted by: Bradfor
 d Woods\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
 iana.edu/event/12514660
DTEND:20260809T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
DTSTART:20260809T143000Z
GEO:39.507470;-86.429030
LOCATION:Bradford Woods
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bradford Brunch
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12514660
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12514660
X-HOSTS:Bradford Woods
END:VEVENT
