LOCATION:President's Hall\, located inside Franklin Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Media School's Academic Premiere
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12440011
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12440011
X-HOSTS:The Media School Undergraduate Program
END:VEVENT
