DESCRIPTION:Pathways to Success: Majors\, Minors\, & Careers Fest is the o
 ne place where students can explore academic and experiential learning pr
 ograms from across IU Bloomington that will help them prepare for academi
 c and career success.\n\nAt this unique event you can quickly gather info
 rmation about opportunities at IU Bloomington that will help you learn ho
 w to build an IU education that supports your goals.\nGet creative about 
 your IU experience: make a button or magnet to show your major pride\, ma
 ke a bracelet to remind yourself of your goal for your IU journey.\nBe su
 re to spin the prize wheel for a chance to win IU giveaways.\nMore detail
 s can be found here.\n\n\nHosted by: Undergraduate Education\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12484
 233
