DESCRIPTION:Jump Into the Semester is a free event that allows students to
  make the progression up the platforms and finally take the 33 foot plung
 e off the 10M platform. Jump Days are offered multiple times throughout t
 he academic year—at the start of each semester in August in January\, and
  again during finals in December and May. Are you ready to take flight an
 d jump off the highest platform at the Counsilman Billingsley Aquatic Cen
 ter?\n\nHosted by: IU Recreational Sports\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12492352
