CATEGORIES:GroupBusiness
DESCRIPTION:The IFC Recruitment Kickoff is designed to give all potential 
 new members (PNMs) a clear\, honest\,and helpful introduction to the recr
 uitment process. This session will walk you through what toexpect during 
 rush\, how the process works\, and how to navigate each stage with confid
 ence. You’llhear directly from IFC leaders about how to approach conversa
 tions\, evaluate chapters\, and makedecisions that are authentic to you.M
 ore than anything\, this event is about setting you up for a positive exp
 erience. We’ll cover tips formaking the most of recruitment\, understandi
 ng chapter values and cultures\, and avoiding commonmistakes. Whether you
 ’re fully committed to rushing or just exploring your options\, this sess
 ion willhelp you feel prepared\, informed\, and confident going into the 
 process.\n\nHosted by: Interfraternity Council at Indiana University\, So
 rority and Fraternity Life\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12500073
DTEND:20260824T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
DTSTART:20260823T220000Z
LOCATION:IMU Alumni Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:IFC Recruitment Kickoff
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12500073
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12500073
X-HOSTS:Sorority and Fraternity Life
END:VEVENT
