CATEGORIES:Social
CATEGORIES:Call-Out Meeting
DESCRIPTION:As a member of RAM at IU\, you will be given the chance to par
 ticipate in Remote Area Medical (RAM) trips. These trips are focused on p
 roviding free services to those who are unable to afford medical care the
 mselves and for those who do not have access to hospitals or healthcare f
 acilities in their area. Through this organization\, members will have th
 e opportunity to volunteer and travel to RAM clinics across the nation. T
 his will be an especially valuable experience to aspiring healthcare prof
 essionals. As an organization\, we also aspire to attain the resources an
 d manpower necessary to help set up and run our very own clinic here in I
 ndiana in the near future. This organization will aspire to promote quali
 ty healthcare both locally and nationally to the fullest of its abilities
 . \n \nWe will have mass meetings twice a month\, where we will hold advo
 cacy moments about pressing health issues in America and beyond\, host gu
 est speakers (e.g. doc talks)\, organize workshops (e.g. suture clinics)\
 , collaborate with other like-minded organizations\, commit to service in
  the community (e.g. volunteering with IRA\, SouthernCare\, GOAL\, etc.)\
 , fundraise for the chapter to attend clinics (e.g. Global Dinner)\, and 
 hold social events. \nAs you can see\, we like to keep ourselves busy! Be
 ing a member is like being part of a family. We strive to foster well-inf
 ormed student leaders that will ultimately take what they learn to better
  the world around us. All we ask of our members is to stay involved and e
 ngaged as best as they can.\n\nHosted by: RAM at IU\n\nAdditional Informa
 tion can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12479709
DTEND:20260901T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
DTSTART:20260831T230000Z
LOCATION:IMU Walnut Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:RAM Callout Meeting
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12479709
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12479709
X-HOSTS:RAM at IU
END:VEVENT
