DESCRIPTION:Join A Kid Again for our fall call-out meeting and learn a lit
 tle bit more about our organization!\nA Kid Again IU is one of three Coll
 egiate Chapters that have been serving families for over 25 years. A Kid 
 Again gives families with a child facing a life-threatening diagnosis a c
 hance to create unique memories through free monthly Adventures and fun e
 vents. As a collegiate chapter\, our support comes in three ways: volunte
 ering\, philanthropy\, and outreach. \nWe would absolutely love to have y
 ou join our organization and help us achieve our goals as a Collegiate Ch
 apter and a National Chapter!\nWe hope to see you there! :)\n\nHosted by:
  A Kid Again IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvo
 lved.indiana.edu/event/12499997
