DESCRIPTION:Starting college can feel exciting\, overwhelming\, and everyt
 hing in between. Join a panel of upperclassmen as they share honest advic
 e\, personal experiences\, and practical strategies for succeeding academ
 ically\, socially\, and personally. From managing classes and time to bui
 lding friendships and finding balance\, this session is designed to help 
 new students start strong and feel more confident navigating college life
 .\n\nHosted by: La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information 
