DESCRIPTION:Nuestras Raíces is an open mic and family-style gathering that
  celebrates personal traditions\, cultures\, and histories. This program 
 honors our familias\, those who came before us whose stories\, and memori
 es help preserve and illuminate the diverse experiences of our communitie
 s across generations.\nJoin us in sharing your own stories\, mementos\, p
 hotographs\, songs\, poems\, writings\, and other meaningful pieces conne
 cted to you. Together\, we create space to connect\, reflect\, and celebr
 ate the roots that shape who we are.\n\nHosted by: La Casa/Latino Cultura
 l Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.in
 diana.edu/event/12504251
