DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the ultimate night of the week with a Big Brother 28
  watch party honoring years of backdoors\, alliances\, and legendary "But
  Firsts." Join us as we watch and discuss the LIVE Thursday night evictio
 n episode\, featuring riveting conversation and maybe food. We'll see.\nW
 hether you're only watching because you think the latest physical beast i
 s hot\, or you're excited to see another massive power player get blindsi
 ded on live television\, our event is open to BB fans new and old! Great 
