DESCRIPTION:This interactive presentation is designed to help undergraduat
 e students build a strong foundation in money management while navigating
  college life. Students will learn the basics of creating a budget\, unde
 rstanding income and expenses\, and developing practical strategies to ma
 nage money throughout the semester. The session explores topics such as f
 inancial aid refunds\, saving habits\, budgeting with changing income\, a
 nd common financial challenges students experience in college. Participan
 ts will leave with simple tools\, resources\, and actionable tips to help
  them make informed financial decisions and build healthy financial habit
 s that support both their academic and personal success.\n \nAll Indiana 
 University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, an
 d historical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the
  Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Asian Culture Center\n\nAddi
 tional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/
 12476632
DTEND:20260929T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
