DESCRIPTION:In partnership with the Office of Career Exploration & Student
  Employment (CESE)\, Career Coach Angela Martin will be available at La C
 asa to provide on-site career coaching and professional guidance for stud
 ents.\nThis is a great opportunity to receive personalized feedback on yo
 ur resume or LinkedIn profile\, discuss career goals\, explore job and in
 ternship opportunities\, or ask questions about your professional develop
 ment. Whether you're just getting started or preparing for your next step
 \, it's never too early or too late to seek career support.\nDrop in\, as
 k questions\, and gain insights to help you move forward with confidence 
 in your career journey.\n\nHosted by: La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nA
 dditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/eve
 nt/12496456
