X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Other
DESCRIPTION:Make Your Voice Heard!\nJoin us for an evening of conversation
 \, learning\, and community as we explore the power of voting and civic e
 ngagement in shaping a more inclusive future for LGBTQ+ communities. Our 
 guest speaker (TBD) will share insights on the history of voting rights\,
  the impact of collective action\, and why participation in the 2026 elec
 tion matters. Whether you’re a first-time voter or a longtime advocate\, 
 you’ll have the opportunity to ask questions\, share perspectives\, and c
 onnect with others who are passionate about making a difference.\nReady t
 o take action? Register to vote! Visit www.indianavoters.in.gov to check 
 your registration status or register to vote (you can also click on the “
 register” button below). Follow the LGBTQ+ Culture Center on QNews\, Face
 book\, and Instagram for voter registration updates\, election informatio
 n\, and important deadlines. The deadline to register to vote in Indiana 
 is October 5\, 2026.\nCome learn\, connect\, and take the next step towar
 d making your voice count.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, acti
 vities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all 
 members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: LGBTQ+ Culture
  Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
 iana.edu/event/12532493
DTEND:20261001T223000Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
DTSTART:20261001T210000Z
GEO:39.168720;-86.525260
LOCATION:LGBTQ+ Culture Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Importance of Voting for the LGBTQ+ Community
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12532493
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12532493
X-HOSTS:LGBTQ+ Culture Center
END:VEVENT
