DESCRIPTION:Come hang out and play board games with us every Friday from 6
 pm to 10pm! Everyone is welcome\, especially if you’re new to the hobby\;
  we love teaching newcomers our favorite games and making sure everyone f
 eels included. You can stay for the full four hours or just drop by for a
  single round\, as the atmosphere is totally casual and flexible. A wide 
 variety of games will be provided at every meeting\, and you are also enc
 ouraged to bring your own favorites along to share. We can't wait to see 
 you there and help you find your next favorite game!\n\nHosted by: \n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/even
 t/12522139
