DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable night of Garba\, where tradition 
 meets celebration! Dance to the vibrant beats of live music\, twirl in co
 lourful attire\, and embrace the energy of this joyful festival! Whether 
 you're an experienced dancer or a first-timer\, everyone is welcome to ta
 ke part in the festivities. Bring your friends and family for a night fil
 led with culture\, community and endless rhythm. Don't miss out\, come ce
 lebrate with us and light up the dance floor! \nKeep an eye out on our In
 stagram and GroupMe for further details closer to the event. \n\nHosted b
 y: Hindu YUVA at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be foun
 d at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12479145
DTEND:20261018T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T032053Z
