 ng games and commentary inbetween commercial breaks.\n \nWhether you've w
 atched all 50 seasons (and the international ones) or you're just looking
  for some people to hang out with and watch Reality TV\, Survivor watch p
 arties are for everyone! Check us out Wednesdays 8PM every week.\n\nHoste
 d by: Live Reality Games @ IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: 
